Hmm... "rickshaw" seems to be me like a rather specific concept. The
significant feature seems to be its appearance, not what it is propelled
by. So why not a fu'ivla (stage-3, short rafsi)?

{carcnrikca}
c1 is a rickshaw for carrying c2 propelled by c3.

c3 could be
1. {lo bajra}/{lo lacpu prenu} (="pulled rickshaw")
2. {lo carvra} (="cycle rickshaw"/"pedicab")
3. {lo matra} (="auto rickshaw"*/"tuk-tuk"/"bajaj"/"mototaxi*")

mu'omi'e jongausib



